  "source": "Кодекс законів про працю України (KZpP), art. 73 (holidays) and art. 67 (weekend holiday → next working day); suspended under martial law (since 24 Feb 2022) by Law No. 2136-IX 'Про організацію трудових відносин в умовах воєнного стану', art. 12. Martial law still in force in 2026. Verified 2026-10-04.",
  "notes": "While martial law lasts, public holidays are NOT days off, so after January 2022 this list is empty (8 March 2022 is not included) (employers may still give days off — add them as company days). The pre-war list (2018–2021, plus 1 and 7 January 2022) is kept for history; years before 2018 are not covered. When martial law ends the post-2023 calendar (Christmas only on 25 Dec, Statehood Day 15 Jul, Defenders' Day 1 Oct) will need a data update.",
